<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it cut is rating on Dillard Department Stores Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 3-1/4 at 29-1/8.</p>
</text>
